  "goodToKnow": "Die Freundlichkeit is friendliness or kindness: Danke für Ihre Freundlichkeit. Germans are sometimes seen as reserved rather than overtly friendly; service in Berlin is famous for the Berliner Schnauze, a blunt, dry manner. Freundlich means friendly, and Mit freundlichen Grüßen is the standard closing of formal letters and emails. Plural (rare): die Freundlichkeiten, kind acts."
